{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-55778","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-63512","text":"OS-008 Agent Harness Protocol — Implementation Build Prompt"}]},{"id":"blk-55779","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-63513","marks":["bold"],"text":"Version:"},{"id":"spn-63514","text":" 1.0 | "},{"id":"spn-63515","marks":["bold"],"text":"Date:"},{"id":"spn-63516","text":" April 2026 | "},{"id":"spn-63517","marks":["bold"],"text":"Type:"},{"id":"spn-63518","text":" Full Implementation (OTP Supervision Tree + MCP)"}]},{"id":"blk-55780","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-63519","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-55781","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-63520","text":"Your Mission"}]},{"id":"blk-55782","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-63521","text":"You are building the "},{"id":"spn-63522","marks":["bold"],"text":"OS-008 Agent Harness Protocol"},{"id":"spn-63523","text":" — the enforcement runtime that sits above agents and below humans. The harness orchestrates [&] pipelines, enforces governance contracts, gates execution on epistemic confidence, and ensures no agent skips retrieval, fabricates provenance, or acts beyond its coverage."}]},{"id":"blk-55783","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-63524","marks":["bold"],"text":"Read `docs/spec/OS-008-HARNESS.md` fully before writing a single line."},{"id":"spn-63525","text":" It is the authoritative spec."}]},{"id":"blk-55784","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-63526","text":"OS-008 is the "},{"id":"spn-63527","marks":["bold"],"text":"enforcement layer"},{"id":"spn-63528","text":" of the dark factory pipeline:"}]},{"id":"blk-55785","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"SpecPrompt (spec in) → Agentelic (build) → OS-008 (enforce) → FleetPrompt (distribute) → RuneFort (observe)"},{"id":"blk-55786","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-63529","text":"The harness wraps agents like an OTP supervisor wraps processes — it doesn't do the work, it ensures the work is done correctly."}]},{"id":"blk-55787","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-63530","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-55788","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-63531","text":"Target Stack"}]},{"id":"blk-55789","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Language:      Elixir 1.17+ / OTP 27\nOTP Patterns:  DynamicSupervisor, GenServer, GenStateMachine\nMCP:           JSON-RPC over HTTP (harness_start_session, harness_sprint_status,\n               harness_approve_action, harness_escalation_response)\nIntegration:   Graphonomous MCP (memory), Delegatic (policy), OS-006 (permissions)\nAuth:          Supabase Auth (shared [&] ecosystem — workspace-scoped sessions)\nTesting:       ExUnit + property-based testing for state machine transitions\nDeploy:        Part of OpenSentience runtime (not standalone)"},{"id":"blk-55790","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-63532","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-55791","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-63533","text":"Repository Structure"}]},{"id":"blk-55792","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-63534","text":"Create this structure inside "},{"id":"spn-63535","marks":["code"],"text":"opensentience.org/lib/"},{"id":"spn-63536","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-55793","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"opensentience.org/\n├── lib/\n│   ├── open_sentience/\n│   │   ├── harness/\n│   │   │   ├── supervisor.ex           # DynamicSupervisor for harness sessions\n│   │   │   ├── session.ex              # Session GenServer — supervises one orchestrated task\n│   │   │   ├── pipeline_enforcer.ex    # Prerequisite constraint model (section 5)\n│   │   │   ├── quality_gate.ex         # Evaluator orchestrator (section 6)\n│   │   │   ├── contract_validator.ex   # [&] governance block enforcement (section 7)\n│   │   │   ├── sprint_controller.ex    # GenStateMachine — planner→generator→evaluator loop (section 9)\n│   │   │   ├── context_manager.ex      # Context window management + compaction (section 8)\n│   │   │   ├── coverage.ex             # Coverage→dispatch routing matrix (section 3.3)\n│   │   │   ├── audit_entry.ex          # Extended audit entry with provenance (section 10)\n│   │   │   ├── tier_adapter.ex         # Model tier adaptation (section 11)\n│   │   │   └── telemetry.ex            # :telemetry events for harness operations\n│   │   ├── harness.ex                  # Public API — start_session, sprint_status, etc.\n│   │   └── harness_mcp/\n│   │       ├── server.ex               # MCP JSON-RPC server (section 13)\n│   │       └── tools.ex                # Tool definitions and handlers\n│   └── open_sentience.ex              # Add harness supervisor to application tree\n├── test/\n│   ├── harness/\n│   │   ├── pipeline_enforcer_test.exs\n│   │   ├── quality_gate_test.exs\n│   │   ├── contract_validator_test.exs\n│   │   ├── sprint_controller_test.exs\n│   │   ├── context_manager_test.exs\n│   │   ├── coverage_test.exs\n│   │   └── session_test.exs\n│   └── fixtures/\n│       ├── customer_support_governance.json   # [&] governance block\n│       ├── sprint_contract.json               # Sample sprint contract\n│       └── coverage_scenarios.json            # Coverage→dispatch test cases\n├── mix.exs\n├── Dockerfile\n└── fly.toml"},{"id":"blk-55794","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-63537","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-55795","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-63538","text":"Implementation Order"}]},{"id":"blk-55796","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-63539","text":"Phase 1: Pipeline Enforcer (weeks 1-3)"}]},{"id":"blk-55797","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-63540","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-63541","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement PipelineEnforcer"},{"id":"spn-63542","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-63543","marks":["code"],"text":"harness/pipeline_enforcer.ex"},{"id":"spn-63544","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-55798","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55800","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-63545","text":"GenServer tracking stage state machine: "},{"id":"spn-63546","marks":["code"],"text":":idle → :retrieving → :analyzing → :deliberating → :acting → :storing"}]}],"id":"blk-55799","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55802","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-63547","text":"Prerequisite rules from section 5.1:"}]}],"id":"blk-55801","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55804","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-63548","marks":["code"],"text":"{:any, :write}"},{"id":"spn-63549","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-63550","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :retrieve_context}"}]}],"id":"blk-55803","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55806","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-63551","marks":["code"],"text":"{:call, :deliberate}"},{"id":"spn-63552","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-63553","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :topology_analyze}"}]}],"id":"blk-55805","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55808","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-63554","marks":["code"],"text":"{:call, :execute_action}"},{"id":"spn-63555","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-63556","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :coverage_query}"}]}],"id":"blk-55807","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55810","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-63557","marks":["code"],"text":"{:call, :learn_from_outcome}"},{"id":"spn-63558","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-63559","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :execute_action}"}]}],"id":"blk-55809","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55812","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-63560","marks":["code"],"text":"{:session, :complete}"},{"id":"spn-63561","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-63562","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :store_node}"}]}],"id":"blk-55811","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55814","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-63563","marks":["code"],"text":"{:sprint, :advance}"},{"id":"spn-63564","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-63565","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :quality_gate, result: :pass}"}]}],"id":"blk-55813","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55816","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-63566","marks":["code"],"text":"check_prerequisite/3"},{"id":"spn-63567","text":" returns "},{"id":"spn-63568","marks":["code"],"text":"{:allow, state}"},{"id":"spn-63569","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-63570","marks":["code"],"text":"{:block, reason, state}"}]}],"id":"blk-55815","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55818","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-63571","text":"Tracks violations as audit entries"}]}],"id":"blk-55817","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55820","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-63572","text":"Wraps MCP tool dispatch — called before every tool invocation"}]}],"id":"blk-55819","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-55821","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-63573","text":"2. "},{"id":"spn-63574","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement the two enforced pipelines"},{"id":"spn-63575","text":" (section 3)"}]},{"id":"blk-55822","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55824","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-63576","text":"Reactive pipeline: "},{"id":"spn-63577","marks":["code"],"text":"query |> recall |> topology |> deliberate(if κ>0) |> store"}]}],"id":"blk-55823","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55826","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-63578","text":"Proactive pipeline: "},{"id":"spn-63579","marks":["code"],"text":"heartbeat |> survey |> triage |> dispatch |> store"}]}],"id":"blk-55825","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55828","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-63580","text":"Coverage→dispatch routing matrix (section 3.3) — 10 routing rules"}]}],"id":"blk-55827","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-55829","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-63581","text":"3. "},{"id":"spn-63582","marks":["bold"],"text":"Integration with OS-006"},{"id":"spn-63583","text":" (section 5.3)"}]},{"id":"blk-55830","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55832","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-63584","text":"OS-008 PipelineEnforcer runs BEFORE OS-006 PermissionEngine"}